&"1_1": {
"dialogue": "A sudden pause in your vision, the actor that you are in control trembles

You heard a voice coming out from your phone.

Don't underestimate me ACTOR 1..",
"offset": Vector2(1900, 37000),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"3_23",
"text": "Watch the show."
}
},
"size": Vector2(310.00018, 420),
"speaker": ""
},
&"1_10": {
"dialogue": "My pleasure.

The man quickly get off the stage.",
"offset": Vector2(4500, 2420),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"3_13",
"text": "Begin the show"
}
},
"size": Vector2(309.9992, 419.99988),
"speaker": ""
},
&"1_11": {
"dialogue": "The back of a second character can be seen, slowly walk from behind the stage up.

The two characters start in their position

My dear, you're almost eighteen.

Your birthday is coming in 1 month. you'll stand before everyone and declare the path you roles.

She smiles.

Have you decided what you want to become?

Then she stops.

She looks directly at you.

She is waiting for your line.",
"offset": Vector2(2160, 10020),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"3_15",
"text": "Mention her dream."
},
1: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"3_12",
"text": "Say something off-topic."
},
2: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"3_14",
"text": "Remain silent."
}
},
"size": Vector2(309.99994, 480.00146),
"speaker": ""
},
&"1_12": {
"dialogue": "You attempt an unrelated response.

ACTOR 1's smile remains frozen for a moment.

She quietly signals you as you are trying to make out her words.

...Hey. I know you love joking but this isn't funny. We are in front of the crowd

She lowers her voice.

Say it again.",
"offset": Vector2(5160, 9360),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"3_16",
"text": "Try another response."
},
1: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"3_16",
"text": "Say nothing."
}
},
"size": Vector2(309.99896, 432.00024),
"speaker": ""
},
&"1_13": {
"dialogue": "The voice of the grumpy stage manager can be heard again from the left side of the stage.

Once upon a time, there is a lovely family in the town.
There, they just bore a new little princess.

She grows up with brilliant beauty, with a majestic voice, blonde hair, and a marvelous, gentle personality.
A month before their daughters turn eighteen, her ACTOR 1 was having tea in the garden, looking at her.",
"offset": Vector2(650, 10100),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"3_11",
"text": "Next Scene."
}
},
"size": Vector2(310, 419.9995),
"speaker": ""
},
&"1_14": {
"dialogue": "The silence lasts too long.

ACTOR 1 glances toward the side of the stage.

Then back at you.

Hey

Your linesss. The scriptttttt!!!",
"offset": Vector2(3980, 11240),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"3_16",
"text": "Try to say something."
}
},
"size": Vector2(309.99994, 420),
"speaker": ""
},
&"1_15": {
"dialogue": "You attempt a response.

ACTOR 1's smile remains frozen for a moment.

She quietly signals you as you are trying to make out her words.

...pss hey. That isn't supposed to be your line.

She lowers her voice.

Say it again.",
"offset": Vector2(3500, 9260),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"3_16",
"text": "Try another response."
},
1: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"3_16",
"text": "Say nothing."
}
},
"size": Vector2(310.00043, 432),
"speaker": ""
},
&"1_16": {
"dialogue": "You try again.

Nothing you say feels right.

The actor stares at you.

Her expression changes.

For just a moment, she stops acting.

... You actually forgot your script. Guess we have to turn to plan B.

Her hands giving signals to the crew.

Something moves beyond the edge of the stage.

A card rises into view on your left.

Look on your side. See anything?",
"offset": Vector2(6680, 10760),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"3_17",
"text": "Read the cue card aloud."
},
1: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"3_18",
"text": "Continue saying something else."
}
},
"size": Vector2(309.9989, 432.00146),
"speaker": ""
},
&"1_17": {
"dialogue": "You notice a white board with handwritten sentence that says:

As you read your lines out while trying to perform, your acting mate continues.

A writer?

And what sort of writer will you be?",
"offset": Vector2(10200, 10740),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"3_21",
"text": "Read the next line."
},
1: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"3_20",
"text": "Say something else."
}
},
"size": Vector2(309.99976, 431.99805),
"speaker": ""
},
&"1_18": {
"dialogue": "A sudden pause in your vision, the actor that you are in control trembles

You heard a voice coming out from your phone.

I WANT TO BECOME A WRITER, JUST LIKE YOU.",
"offset": Vector2(8000, 12020),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"3_17",
"text": "Watch the show"
},
