&"1_2": {
"dialogue": "You failed to follow the order.
You have killed the MC.",
"offset": Vector2(650, 37850),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": "END",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 288.00098),
"speaker": ""
},
&"1_20": {
"dialogue": "You say something unexpected again... as expected of you.

People are waiting for your response again.",
"offset": Vector2(11240, 13280),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"3_21",
"text": "Read the next line."
},
1: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"3_22",
"text": "Say something else."
}
},
"size": Vector2(309.99805, 432.00146),
"speaker": ""
},
&"1_21": {
"dialogue": "You read your lines out again

I want to create stories people can gather around and remember.

A lovely ambition.

That's lovely, dear, but I hope you won't get overwhelmed by the sheer pain in your fingers and getting calluses, writing so much with you.",
"offset": Vector2(13200, 11400),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"3_23",
"text": "Read the line."
},
1: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"3_20",
"text": "Say something else again."
}
},
"size": Vector2(310.0017, 432.00146),
"speaker": ""
},
&"1_22": {
"dialogue": "A sudden pause in your vision, the actor that you are in control trembles

You heard a voice coming out from your phone.

I WANT TO CREATE STORIES PEOPLE CAN GATHER AROUND AND REMEMBER.",
"offset": Vector2(12480, 13280),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"3_21",
"text": "Watch the show."
}
},
"size": Vector2(310, 420.00146),
"speaker": ""
},
&"1_23": {
"dialogue": "I'll be fine.

By the time, I will make more happy people reading my books than caring about the little bumps, pain in my finger.

ACTOR 1 smiles.

Great. Now go on.

We should have a lot of work to do before your birthday comes.

Me and father are gonna organize a big party.

We're gonna invite people all around the kingdom to visit, to attend your own birthday.

Preparations begin throughout the kingdom.
The princess's eighteenth birthday is approaching.
In this world, reaching eighteen is not only a birthday.
It is also the moment when a young person stands before the people around them and announces the social position, vocation, or path they intend to follow as an adult.

The bluish hue of  the curtain slightly takes on the tin of yellow, it push the player back to the main menu.",
"offset": Vector2(15650, 11800),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"3_24",
"text": "Continue the game"
},
1: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"3_57",
"text": "Quit the game"
}
},
"size": Vector2(310, 431.99854),
"speaker": ""
},
&"1_24": {
"dialogue": "Before you can start the game, on the second screen, you see a spark of light cast on a thin long lines. It runs through quickly before disappear. It happens almost immediate.

And then the Stage manager standing from the other side (on your computer), elegantly walk out, still with his despise look on you.

One month passes.
The day of the celebration finally arrives.
People from around the kingdom gather for the princess's birthday and declaration.

The hall is crowded.
