 some confirmation.\"}, {\"kind\": \"narration\", \"speaker\": \"\", \"text\": \"She swiftly leaves her breadth out, take a slow moment before she continues\"}, {\"kind\": \"dialogue\", \"speaker\": \"Actor 1\", \"text\": \"You'll tell everyone that you're entering the writing profession, won't you?\"}, {\"kind\": \"narration\", \"speaker\": \"\", \"text\": \"She looks at you attentively.\"}, {\"kind\": \"narration\", \"speaker\": \"\", \"text\": \"All the eyes of the audience are casting upon YOU. (including the MC)/\"}, {\"kind\": \"narration\", \"speaker\": \"\", \"text\": \"You wait for the cue.\"}, {\"kind\": \"narration\", \"speaker\": \"\", \"text\": \"Nothing.\"}, {\"kind\": \"narration\", \"speaker\": \"\", \"text\": \"ACTOR 1 looks at you expectantly, eyes landing on you waiting for your next move.\"}, {\"kind\": \"narration\", \"speaker\": \"\", \"text\": \"Then, late, the card changes.\"}, {\"kind\": \"phone\", \"speaker\": \"\", \"text\": \"AGREE\"}], \"context\": \"\", \"player_task\": \"Respond to the current scene.\", \"author_notes\": [\"REVIEW: The cue says AGREE, but every answer, including Yes, currently leads to A2_4_Decline. No new reaction has been invented.\"], \"grammar_warnings\": [], \"production_hooks\": {\"ON ENTER\": [], \"ON LISTEN\": [], \"ON ACCEPT\": [], \"ON UNCLEAR\": [], \"ON SILENCE\": [], \"ON QUESTION\": [], \"ON OFFSCRIPT\": []}, \"allowed_authored_intents\": {\"choice_0\": {\"meaning\": \"No.\", \"destination\": \"A2_7_Decline\"}, \"choice_1\": {\"meaning\": \"Yes.\", \"destination\": \"A2_7_Agree\"}, \"choice_2\": {\"meaning\": \"I'm not sure anymore.\", \"destination\": \"A2_7_NotSure\"}, \"choice_3\": {\"meaning\": \"I've changed my mind.\", \"destination\": \"A2_7_ChangeYourMind\"}}, \"response_overrides\": {}, \"bounded_evidence\": {}, \"input_mode\": \"speech\", \"narrative_purpose\": \"\", \"mc_behaviour\": [], \"npc_behaviour\": [], \"assets_required\": [], \"state_changes\": {}, \"missing_logic\": []}"
